OL,4,CVeteran Nigerian Nollywood actor Pete  
OL,5,CEdochie dies aged 79                   
OL,6,GVeteran Nigerian actor Pete Edochie,   
OL,7,Gone of Africa's most celebrated film   
OL,8,Gstars, has died at the age of 79, his  
OL,9,Gfamily has announced.                  
OL,11,FKnown for his deep voice, commanding   
OL,12,Fscreen presence and memorable use of   
OL,13,FAfrican proverbs, Edochie became a     
OL,14,Fhousehold name across Africa, often    
OL,15,Fportraying powerful traditional        
OL,16,Frulers, wealthy businessmen and family 
OL,17,Fpatriarchs.                            
